      "comment": "Shuts down the DirectDraw subsystem and releases all associated resources.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Check if DirectDraw is initialized (g_bDirectDrawInitialized != NULL)\n  2. If not initialized, skip to step 9\n  3. Call CloseDirectDrawWindow to close the DD window\n  4. Release IDirectDraw interface (g_pDirectDraw) via COM Release (+0x8)\n  5. Log \"Shutting down DirectDraw...\" via QueueLogMessage\n  6. Release IDirectDrawSurface primary (g_pPrimarySurface) via COM Release (+0x8)\n  7. Release IDirectDrawSurface back buffer (g_pBackBuffer) via COM Release (+0x8)\n  8. Log \"...DirectDraw shut down.\" via QueueLogMessage\n  9. If critical section exists (g_pDirectDrawCritSection):\n     a. Call DeleteCriticalSection\n     b. Call ReleasePoolAllocation to free memory\n  10. Clear all global pointers to NULL\n  11. Return 1 (success)\n\n  Parameters:\n    None - This function takes no parameters.\n\n  Returns:\n    int - Always returns 1 (TRUE) indicating success.\n\n  Global Variables Modified:\n    g_bDirectDrawInitialized (0x6f8f1b94) - Set to NULL\n    g_pDirectDraw (0x6f8f1bc4) - Released and set to NULL\n    g_pPrimarySurface (0x6f8f1ba8) - Released and set to NULL\n    g_pBackBuffer (0x6f8f1ba4) - Released and set to NULL\n    g_dwLogContext (0x6f8f153c) - Set to NULL\n    g_pDirectDrawCritSection (0x6f8f1bd0) - Deleted and set to NULL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:546c17e22a38a8e15c8829671ea3e893",
