      "name": "InitializeDirectDrawSurface",
      "signature": "void InitializeDirectDrawSurface(uint dwCooperativeLevel, int * phTargetWindow)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes or releases DirectDraw surfaces with critical section protection.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Get or create DirectDraw critical section for thread synchronization\n    2. Enter critical section to prevent concurrent access\n    3. Check nReleaseMode flag - if set, release surface and exit\n    4. Store cooperative level flag in g_dwDirectDrawActive\n    5. Call DirectDraw SetCooperativeLevel with DDSCL_EXCLUSIVE (0x11)\n    6. Clear palette buffer g_aPaletteEntries (256 DWORDs)\n    7. Create DirectDraw palette with 4 entries via CreatePalette\n    8. Call InitializeDirectDrawWindow with target window handle\n    9. Exit critical section\n\n  Parameters:\n    dwCooperativeLevel - Cooperative level flags (ECX register)\n    phTargetWindow - Target window handle for DirectDraw (EDX register)\n\n  Returns:\n    void - No explicit return value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:546c17e22a38a8e15c8829671ea3e893",
