      "name": "LogDirectDrawError",
      "signature": "undefined LogDirectDrawError(undefined4 param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Maps DirectDraw error codes to error message strings and logs them.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check for special non-error codes (0x887601ae, 0x887601c2) - skip logging\n  2. Use nested comparisons to route error code to appropriate message table\n  3. For ranges with dense error codes, use lookup table (offset-based jump table)\n  4. Load message pointer from appropriate data address\n  5. Call QueueLogMessage with format string and error code\n  6. Return void\n\nParameters:\n  ECX pContext - unused parameter (fastcall convention)\n  EDX dwErrorCode - DirectDraw HRESULT error code (negative values)\n\nReturns:\n  void - always returns normally\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Codes 0x887601ae, 0x887601c2: silently ignored (no logging)\n  - Code 0x00000000: logs default error message\n  - Unknown codes: logs default error message\n  - All known codes: logs specific DirectDraw error message strings",
