      "name": "GetByteParameter",
      "signature": "byte GetByteParameter(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "byte",
      "comment": "Retrieves a byte parameter from the call stack at a fixed offset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Access stack parameter at offset 0x10 from ESP\n  2. Load byte value into AL register\n  3. Return to caller with AL as return value\n\nParameters:\n  IMPLICIT - Byte value passed on stack at [ESP + 0x10]\n\nReturns:\n  AL - Byte value retrieved from stack offset 0x10\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  None - Simple accessor function with no error conditions",
