      "name": "FormatFloatValue",
      "signature": "int * FormatFloatValue(dword dwValue, dword dwPrecision, int * pResult, dword * pdwDigits)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int *",
      "comment": "Formats a floating-point value into component parts and digit array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract exponent and mantissa components from float representation\n2. Call FUN_6f9e83b6 to initialize conversion buffer\n3. Call FUN_6f9ec053 to convert float to digit array\n4. Extract sign, exponent, and mantissa values into output structure\n5. Call FUN_6f9e8470 to finalize digit array\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue: Floating-point value bits (IEEE 754 format)\n- dwPrecision: Precision/scale for conversion\n- pResult: Output structure for sign, exponent, mantissa (3 dwords)\n- pdwDigits: Array pointer for digit output (6 dwords)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to output result structure (pResult)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6f9e83b6: Initialize conversion buffer\n- FUN_6f9ec053: Convert to digit representation\n- FUN_6f9e8470: Finalize digit array",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
